From: Elarossa Bugfix <assistant@elarossa.local>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:18:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add admin-gated CJ product import tool
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- lib/admin.ts: simple shared-secret auth (ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN env var,
  fails closed if unset), checked via x-admin-token header
- /api/cj/products: re-enabled as a live search over the CJ catalogue,
  admin-gated (404 to anyone without a valid token)
- /api/cj/products/[pid]: new route, fetches one CJ product + variants
  and returns it pre-shaped via toCJStoreProduct() for the storefront
- /admin/products: token-gated UI to search CJ, preview a product, and
  copy a ready-to-paste lib/products.ts entry. Does not write files or
  publish products automatically — the catalogue stays static TS, and
  Vercel's production filesystem is read-only anyway
- robots.ts: disallow /admin/ so the tool stays out of search engines
- .env.example: document the new ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN variable
